    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d190">

                <pb facs="0306" n="140" xml:id="pg140"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/1805</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Page to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-09-11T16:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 11, 1917, 4
                        p.m</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>7150. Your 5399, September 8, 4 p.m. Foreign Office expresses tentatively
                    agreement with your views and tell me they know nothing of the desired loan of
                    200,000,000 Mexican dollars.</p>
                <p>They will however communicate with British Legation, Peking, and send me definite
                    answer later.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Page</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
